{"seq":3,"slug":"performance","title":"性能优化篇","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cold-start-optimization","title":"冷启动速度优化","url":"/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/cold-start-optimization","wordCount":916,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"运行时内存管理","url":"/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/memory-management","wordCount":915,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-optimization","title":"渲染性能与帧率优化","url":"/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/rendering-optimization","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# 性能优化篇\n\nElectron 应用最常被诟病的痛点是冷启动慢和内存占用高。本章提供系统性的性能治理方案，覆盖三个维度：冷启动速度优化（从 V8 代码缓存到延迟加载策略）、运行时内存管理（进程复用、泄漏检测、GC 调优），以及渲染性能与帧率优化（离屏渲染、GPU 加速策略、DOM 虚拟化）。\n\n每个主题都配有可量化的优化目标与可落地的代码方案，目标是将典型 Electron 应用的冷启动压缩到 500ms 以内、常驻内存控制在合理阈值。\n"}